  "description": "General Biology examines life from biomolecules and cells through organisms, populations, and ecosystems. Students build mechanistic explanations, interpret biological data, perform safe and reproducible laboratory work, and apply evolutionary and systems thinking to biomedical engineering and nutrition. Emphasis falls on structure\u2013function relationships, information, energy, homeostasis, variation, and evidence.",
